From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ugur-imd <ugur.acikgoz@imd-tec.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] board: imdt-v2n-sbc: fix include and macro name for
 ARCH_RENESAS

With ARCH_RENESAS now selected (see the defconfig arch-selection fix),
asm/arch/rmobile.h no longer resolves - that header only exists under
the legacy ARCH_RMOBILE tree. imdt-v2h-sbc.c, which already builds
correctly under ARCH_RENESAS, includes asm/arch/renesas.h instead.

CONFIG_SYS_TEXT_BASE was also renamed upstream to CONFIG_TEXT_BASE
(see the defconfig fix); the old macro is no longer defined by Kconfig
under ARCH_RENESAS, causing a build failure ('CONFIG_SYS_TEXT_BASE'
undeclared). imdt-v2h-sbc.c already uses CONFIG_TEXT_BASE at the
equivalent line.

---
 board/imdt/imdt-v2n-sbc/imdt-v2n-sbc.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/board/imdt/imdt-v2n-sbc/imdt-v2n-sbc.c b/board/imdt/imdt-v2n-sbc/imdt-v2n-sbc.c
index b0a053c..8bac461 100644
--- a/board/imdt/imdt-v2n-sbc/imdt-v2n-sbc.c
+++ b/board/imdt/imdt-v2n-sbc/imdt-v2n-sbc.c
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 #include <asm/arch/sys_proto.h>
 #include <asm/gpio.h>
 #include <asm/arch/gpio.h>
-#include <asm/arch/rmobile.h>
+#include <asm/arch/renesas.h>
 #include <asm/arch/rcar-mstp.h>
 #include <asm/arch/sh_sdhi.h>
 #include <i2c.h>
@@ -253,7 +253,7 @@ int board_early_init_f(void)
 int board_init(void)
 {
 	/* address of boot parameters */
-	gd->bd->bi_boot_params = CONFIG_SYS_TEXT_BASE + 0x50000;
+	gd->bd->bi_boot_params = CONFIG_TEXT_BASE + 0x50000;
 
 	board_usb_init();
 
-- 
2.34.1

